{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"739055783806894110","content":"Around the building is a ring of spiders, allowing the two to have their privacy. The spiders also form a nice path from the front to the back of the building. In a nearby tree a small bird is chirping happily. It and the spiders seem to be friendly.","created_at":"2020-08-08T22:57:13.837000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741792164450926662","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"739055783806894110","content":"The ground is pretty dirty and muddy due to the flooding, and there is a section that appears to be a garden.","created_at":"2020-08-08T22:59:42.846000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741792789439709294","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"739055783806894110","content":"||\"Baeshra no long know Baeshra parents names. Baeshra one of five. Last know names Mirik, mean song, she like sing while work. Kepesk, mean storm, he only go hunt when sky roars. Kosj, mean small. More small than Baeshra, Baeshra small to others of Baeshra old tribe. Others die before earn new names. Baeshra come from lands of swamps. Much like home now. Baeshra no know if village have name. Only ever call village or home. Much far from London. Baeshra learn honor from tribe. Much honor mean good life. Baeshra live many years in village. Learn much of hunt, of honor, of tribe. Baeshra want be hunter, not all be hunters. Some seers. Some do village things. Baeshra learn much pride be Lizardfolk. Strong scales. Sharp teeth. Strong. Fast. Swim. Not like fleshlings with steel clothes and shiny sticks. But Baeshra people use sharp sticks too. Baeshra to proud of teeth. Baeshra become Baeshra. Hunt like panther. Hide in dark. Pounce kill. Good hunt. Not all hunt hide but hide help on some prey. Then Subeak... Baeshra kill Subeak... tribe much no want Baeshra for kill Subeak. Baeshra know. Baeshra no fight. Baeshra take few things. Leave tribe. Baeshra travel many days. Hunt only feed Baeshra, no honor hunts. Only small.  Soon Baeshra meet fleshlings making camp. Two much fear Baeshra think Baeshra want kill. But old one talk down, invite Baeshra eat with, and guard for night so they sleep. Baeshra agree, no find food few days. Food smell much good. Baeshra keep think of meal few times. Small stew. Bread bowl. Much cheese over all. Much good. Many taste. Baeshra old tribe only cook food. No season. Baeshra first time with seasons. Baeshra love much. Baeshra stay with three, protect many nights. Old man teach Baeshra how make food taste much good. Baeshra never learn names... Baeshra protect three to thier home. But Three's village no like Baeshra. ||","created_at":"2020-08-08T22:59:54.812000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741792839628881982","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Mistah Noodles","id":"363458590461132800","is_bot":0,"username":"mistahnoodles"},"author_id":"363458590461132800","channel_id":"739055783806894110","content":"||Old man give Baeshra gifts, just for cooking. Baeshra leave sad village no like Baeshra.  But Baeshra leave. Baeshra travel long  time no know how long. Travel by foot. Travel by boat. Baeshra protect some, Baeshra help with hunt with some. Much time Baeshra alone. Long time. Then Baeshra hear of London. Much big village. Baeshra ank cysts learn more tastes all place Baeshra go. Much big village mean much flavor to try. Baeshra make way to London. First day in London, Baeshra meet Web.\"||","created_at":"2020-08-08T23:00:03.456000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741792875884576790","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
