{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"739055783806894110","content":"||“Web never know blood parents. Web found by circle when young, raised by them. Web raised most by spin-mother Ishka most. Ishka Kraul, insect person. Ishka help raise spiders, other creatures. From her Web learn, Web learn quickly. Web have natural talent. Web good with spiders. For many years, Web work with spiders to scavenge. Meet other scavengers. Web know Jennerus Jack long time.” At this, Web tears up. “Jennerus Jack good friend.”||\n||“Web first hunt against rats. Rats take corpse from Web and spiders, Web have to fight rat king. Web kill rat king, eat heart. Show other rats strong. Rats stay away from circle territory after that.” Web pulls out their notebook of information about Skitter. “Wish could tell from own memory, but have to from Skitter.” Web sighs and continues.||\n||“Was watching him through grates for long time. Wanted to see little performances, tricks. Funny when fancy above folk get tricked and don’t know. One day Skitter come up, introduce self. Become good friends quickly. Become more than friends. Siblings. Whenever Skitter in trouble, hungry, Web there to help. Save from hurt badly. Make clothes, fix clothes. Web help Skitter. Make Skitter cake for birthday.||\n||When Web become older, become adult in circle. When adult, Web want make new home like circle home. Help others like circle help Web. Circle approve, but not know where Web go. One day, Web hear above folk talk about fancy boat, go to new world. Web decide to go. Then Web meet Baeshra.”||","created_at":"2020-08-08T23:04:19.338000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"741793949131341905","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
